    void setInteractive( bool interactive );
%Docstring
When ``interactive`` is ``False`` the tooltip ignores the pointer
entirely: its links and image stop being clickable, and clicks and drags
pass straight through to the canvas beneath it.

Used while a map tool owns the pointer, where the tooltip is a preview
rather than something to be operated. Interactive by default.
%End

